WEBVTT

01:50.090 --> 01:53.940
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.360 --> 01:56.840
[Episode 26]

02:31.120 --> 02:31.800
Xiu,

02:32.220 --> 02:34.020
get your dad a bowl of soup first.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.579
Did you get burned?

02:49.560 --> 02:50.560
What happened?

02:53.270 --> 02:54.170
Did you get burned?

02:54.170 --> 02:54.930
Let me see.

02:55.390 --> 02:56.110
Let me see.

02:58.380 --> 03:01.540
♪ Fireworks scatter across the sky ♪

02:59.000 --> 02:59.790
Don't cry.

02:59.810 --> 03:01.740
I'll go find some ointment for you.

03:01.910 --> 03:06.040
♪ And the faint light in my eyes
fades with them ♪

03:05.910 --> 03:06.630
Dad.

03:07.400 --> 03:08.310
I am...

03:07.990 --> 03:11.290
♪ Just like the end of our story ♪

03:09.040 --> 03:10.110
I am sorry.

03:11.930 --> 03:13.820
♪ Who says ♪

03:12.800 --> 03:14.240
I'm sorry.

03:14.250 --> 03:18.630
♪ We meet just to say goodbye? ♪

03:15.120 --> 03:16.520
I'm sorry, every day...

03:17.000 --> 03:18.310
The first thing I do every morning

03:18.310 --> 03:20.000
is trying to forget him,

03:19.470 --> 03:24.410
♪ Who's to blame for a fate like this? ♪

03:20.000 --> 03:21.430
but I can't.

03:22.590 --> 03:23.150
Dad.

03:24.910 --> 03:26.520
I'm still worried about him.

03:25.660 --> 03:28.410
♪ Walking across ♪

03:26.520 --> 03:29.800
I still want to face everything with him.

03:29.610 --> 03:35.160
♪ This hollow bridge of fate ♪

03:31.400 --> 03:32.800
I'm sorry, Dad.

03:33.870 --> 03:34.710
Dad.

03:36.440 --> 03:41.660
♪ If you can't see the other shore,
just look up ♪

03:42.520 --> 03:43.710
I'm sorry.

03:43.270 --> 03:45.490
♪ Only a few stars shine ♪

03:46.540 --> 03:49.710
♪ It's true ♪

03:50.350 --> 03:53.620
♪ I miss you ♪

03:53.640 --> 03:59.880
♪ Hope the night brings me to you ♪

04:01.100 --> 04:03.740
♪ And I also know ♪

04:04.340 --> 04:10.690
♪ The night will pass
and I have to part with you ♪

04:11.410 --> 04:19.589
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

04:38.120 --> 04:39.650
The inquiry ended long ago,

04:39.950 --> 04:42.170
but his phone
has been powered off the whole time.

04:42.170 --> 04:44.130
♪ It's true ♪

04:44.430 --> 04:45.120
Sorry.

04:45.270 --> 04:47.190
The phone you are calling is powered off.

04:46.050 --> 04:48.230
♪ I loved you ♪

04:47.430 --> 04:49.800
The phone you are calling is powered off.

04:48.659 --> 04:54.730
♪ Hope the dream brings me to you ♪

04:56.520 --> 04:58.480
♪ And I also know ♪

04:58.510 --> 05:04.670
♪ The dreams are false
and I should forget you ♪

05:03.480 --> 05:04.270
Xiao Zhiyu!

05:05.190 --> 05:05.950
Xiao Zhiyu.

05:06.020 --> 05:16.020
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

05:11.870 --> 05:12.700
Xiao Zhiyu.

05:28.120 --> 05:28.800
Sorry.

05:28.950 --> 05:31.210
The phone you are calling is powered off.

05:35.510 --> 05:36.240
Hello.

05:37.340 --> 05:38.020
Hello,

05:38.510 --> 05:39.360
Ms. Hu.

05:39.830 --> 05:41.480
I'm Xiao Zhiyu's mother,

05:41.970 --> 05:42.890
Xiao Wanyue.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.950
Hello, Ms. Xiao.

05:47.080 --> 05:48.080
Sorry.

05:48.430 --> 05:50.040
I'm really anxious,

05:50.270 --> 05:52.360
so I asked someone for your number.

05:52.920 --> 05:54.040
I just want to ask

05:54.159 --> 05:55.870
if Zhiyu is with you.

05:57.000 --> 05:59.159
Ms. Xiao, I can't reach him either.

05:59.720 --> 06:01.270
If I get any news about Mr. Xiao,

06:01.270 --> 06:03.000
I'll contact you immediately.

06:03.750 --> 06:04.920
Thank you.

06:05.830 --> 06:06.750
I'm just worried

06:06.750 --> 06:09.150
that something might have happened to him.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.120
Ms. Xiao, don't worry.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.250
I just asked around.

06:11.390 --> 06:13.390
Mr. Xiao just finished the inquiry.

06:13.630 --> 06:16.030
He must have been delayed
by something else

06:16.560 --> 06:18.490
and hasn't turned his phone on yet.

06:18.800 --> 06:20.040
What inquiry?

06:22.130 --> 06:24.510
Forma filed a complaint
against the studio,

06:24.510 --> 06:27.960
saying Mr. Xiao is suspected
of leaking supplier information.

06:27.960 --> 06:29.080
You didn't know?

06:30.270 --> 06:31.310
No wonder...

06:31.800 --> 06:33.070
No wonder he just

06:33.360 --> 06:35.020
got into a fight with Pei Zhen.

06:36.570 --> 06:38.630
I didn't even know what he was facing,

06:38.630 --> 06:39.900
yet I blamed him.

06:41.040 --> 06:41.950
I shouldn't have said

06:41.950 --> 06:43.750
those words to him.

06:45.190 --> 06:45.990
Ms. Xiao,

06:46.020 --> 06:47.820
what did you say to him?

07:01.410 --> 07:03.240
He left without a word back then

07:03.990 --> 07:06.340
and left it all to me.

07:06.880 --> 07:08.340
How could I not resent him?

07:08.560 --> 07:09.510
Zhiyu,

07:09.990 --> 07:11.580
it's not easy to turn black

07:11.600 --> 07:12.800
into white

07:13.160 --> 07:14.960
through your own efforts alone.

07:15.270 --> 07:17.000
This path is tough.

07:17.680 --> 07:19.360
You dare not use your own name.

07:20.160 --> 07:20.800
You changed your name,

07:20.800 --> 07:22.160
yet you can't forget.

07:22.680 --> 07:25.340
So you can only use
the name "Qin Xiaoyi" in the game

07:25.340 --> 07:26.540
to comfort yourself.

07:27.720 --> 07:28.800
How pathetic.

07:29.120 --> 07:31.630
You don't have to
accept my choice back then,

07:31.920 --> 07:34.780
and you can blame me
for being weak and incompetent.

07:34.860 --> 07:35.560
But do you

07:35.870 --> 07:37.080
really have to

07:37.360 --> 07:38.890
make me lose my family again

07:39.320 --> 07:40.850
before you're satisfied?

08:15.830 --> 08:16.630
Hu Xiu.

08:33.570 --> 08:37.159
♪ Wind stops between
the corners of a rebooted street ♪

08:37.650 --> 08:41.390
♪ I see the foreshadowing of fate ♪

08:41.900 --> 08:45.530
♪ In that moment,
the world freezes in place ♪

08:45.770 --> 08:48.620
♪ Like flickering frames in a game ♪

08:50.140 --> 08:51.560
♪ Opening the drifting dust ♪

08:51.590 --> 08:53.880
♪ You smile like light—so unexpected ♪

08:53.900 --> 08:55.720
♪ I hear our hearts matching ♪

08:55.740 --> 08:57.820
♪ In the collapse of this era ♪

08:58.460 --> 09:00.590
♪ Maybe I'll wake up ♪

09:00.610 --> 09:02.300
♪ Maybe I shouldn't ♪

09:02.650 --> 09:05.830
♪ But the blank space in your eyes ♪

09:04.670 --> 09:05.870
I ran all the way here

09:05.860 --> 09:07.680
♪ Time and space howl ♪

09:06.600 --> 09:08.200
and figured out one thing.

09:07.730 --> 09:10.610
♪ Crossing paths of destiny ♪

09:10.120 --> 09:11.720
I don't care who you are

09:10.630 --> 09:12.470
♪ Dreams overturn ♪

09:11.720 --> 09:12.960
or what you're hiding anymore.

09:12.530 --> 09:15.950
♪ With you,
I don't want to run away at all ♪

09:16.010 --> 09:16.860
♪ This heart of mine ♪

09:16.880 --> 09:18.700
♪ Falls for you over and over ♪

09:17.910 --> 09:19.390
I just want to stay by your side.

09:18.760 --> 09:20.610
♪ Shattered, pieced together ♪

09:20.630 --> 09:23.020
♪ At least I once shone ♪

09:21.670 --> 09:22.930
I just want to love you.

09:23.070 --> 09:24.550
♪ Time and space howl ♪

09:24.580 --> 09:27.460
♪ Crossing paths of destiny ♪

09:27.610 --> 09:29.460
♪ Dreams overturn ♪

09:29.510 --> 09:32.940
♪ With you,
I don't want to run away at all ♪

09:30.120 --> 09:30.840
Hu Xiu.

09:32.990 --> 09:33.840
♪ This heart of mine ♪

09:33.870 --> 09:35.690
♪ Falls for you over and over ♪

09:35.150 --> 09:36.030
I love you.

09:35.750 --> 09:37.590
♪ Shattered, pieced together ♪

09:37.760 --> 09:40.620
♪ At least I once shone ♪

09:40.650 --> 09:44.670
♪Ah, ah, ah ♪

09:44.780 --> 09:48.740
♪Ah, ah, ah ♪

09:49.060 --> 09:56.440
♪Ah, ah, ah ♪

09:57.250 --> 09:58.780
♪ Because beyond this lifetime ♪

09:59.390 --> 10:01.170
♪ We're still entangled ♪

10:01.190 --> 10:05.320
♪ We fall in love beneath a virtual sky,
never to part ♪

10:05.350 --> 10:09.820
♪ Let our embrace land in a sea of stars ♪

10:09.850 --> 10:13.030
♪ Be the exception in your doomsday loop ♪

10:13.050 --> 10:14.780
♪ As time burns ♪

10:15.070 --> 10:17.780
♪ Flying across heaven and earth
to hold you close ♪

10:17.810 --> 10:19.690
♪ Illusions topple ♪

10:19.710 --> 10:22.950
♪ I can hold your hands tight ♪

10:22.990 --> 10:24.390
♪ My madness ♪

10:24.420 --> 10:25.910
♪ Spins for you until the break of dawn ♪

10:25.930 --> 10:28.530
♪ This moment ♪

10:28.560 --> 10:34.790
♪ Is real and shining ♪

11:26.720 --> 11:28.580
I saw your fridge was empty again,

11:28.670 --> 11:30.440
so I just found a bit of bread.

11:31.530 --> 11:32.650
Let's eat out then.

11:34.150 --> 11:36.230
I still need to go back
to my parents' place today.

11:36.230 --> 11:37.030
After I prepare this for you,

11:37.030 --> 11:38.440
I should get going.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.200
The floor is cold.

11:57.970 --> 11:58.450
Come.

12:04.710 --> 12:06.920
Those slippers you bought me before—

12:07.150 --> 12:08.600
I took them as my own

12:08.870 --> 12:10.130
and brought them home.

12:12.630 --> 12:13.470
I'll buy you new ones.

12:13.470 --> 12:14.470
Wear mine for now.

12:37.540 --> 12:38.940
It doesn't hurt anymore.

12:41.150 --> 12:42.790
The information leak incident—

12:42.790 --> 12:44.790
they were targeting you on purpose.

12:44.960 --> 12:45.870
Right?

12:46.720 --> 12:48.450
Will it be difficult to handle?

12:55.390 --> 12:57.450
My investigation into the suppliers

12:58.030 --> 12:59.630
was within reasonable bounds.

12:59.630 --> 13:02.090
I explained everything clearly yesterday.

13:04.600 --> 13:05.600
Their move

13:06.300 --> 13:07.080
is just to delay

13:07.080 --> 13:08.960
my contact with Mr. Huang.

13:12.840 --> 13:13.750
Don't worry.

13:14.270 --> 13:16.090
No matter what happens in the future,

13:16.090 --> 13:17.820
I won't hide anything from you.

13:19.870 --> 13:21.840
I want you to protect yourself.

13:23.000 --> 13:23.800
In the future,

13:24.280 --> 13:26.540
don't leave me not knowing where you are.

13:29.320 --> 13:29.960
Okay.

13:30.370 --> 13:31.170
I promise you.

13:45.630 --> 13:46.320
Hu Xiu,

13:46.550 --> 13:48.120
I'm almost 30.

13:48.390 --> 13:49.870
You're 30 years old,

13:50.120 --> 13:53.050
and you're still
playing elementary school tricks.

14:13.210 --> 14:15.010
You really won't come for a bite?

14:15.150 --> 14:17.080
I made it for you in the first place.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.270
When I get to my parents' place,

14:18.270 --> 14:19.510
I'll eat with them.

14:25.720 --> 14:26.770
There's something

14:26.770 --> 14:28.630
I haven't had a chance to tell you.

14:30.790 --> 14:33.360
Your mom came looking for you yesterday.

14:37.640 --> 14:39.300
She's very worried about you.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.720
She also regrets

14:42.260 --> 14:44.060
saying those harsh words to you.

14:49.630 --> 14:50.550
I understand.

14:51.150 --> 14:54.200
You don't want the people
you care about getting involved,

14:54.200 --> 14:56.200
so you haven't told her many things,

14:56.790 --> 14:58.990
just like you hid things from me before.

15:00.510 --> 15:01.550
But sometimes,

15:01.910 --> 15:02.840
keeping secrets

15:03.030 --> 15:04.960
is crueler than knowing the truth.

15:11.280 --> 15:12.040
I see.

15:20.080 --> 15:20.910
What's wrong?

15:21.480 --> 15:22.480
Whose message?

15:23.510 --> 15:24.150
Zhou Yan.

15:24.780 --> 15:26.840
Did something happen at the company?

15:27.760 --> 15:30.090
You know the Lanjing Park project, right?

15:30.300 --> 15:31.830
They heard about the studio

15:31.910 --> 15:33.020
being investigated

15:33.020 --> 15:35.280
and proposed to terminate the contract.

15:35.960 --> 15:37.200
And Lyman

15:37.710 --> 15:39.070
raised work concerns.

15:40.840 --> 15:43.450
They want me to withdraw
from the construction phase?

15:43.450 --> 15:44.650
It's just temporary.

15:46.030 --> 15:48.820
The information leak matter
is still under investigation,

15:48.820 --> 15:51.320
and I'm the one
responsible for project liaison.

15:51.320 --> 15:52.840
Their request

15:53.080 --> 15:54.210
is understandable.

15:54.440 --> 15:54.790
Hu Xiu.

15:54.790 --> 15:56.000
The innocent need no defense.

15:56.000 --> 15:59.060
I believe the investigation
will clarify things soon.

15:59.150 --> 16:01.080
With no work these few days anyway,

16:01.670 --> 16:04.000
I'll just spend more time with my parents.

16:05.000 --> 16:05.870
Let me drive you home.

16:05.870 --> 16:07.790
You focus
on handling your company matters.

16:07.790 --> 16:08.990
Don't worry about me.

16:09.000 --> 16:09.730
I'm leaving.

16:13.120 --> 16:14.720
Call me if anything comes up.

16:16.880 --> 16:17.520
Bye bye.

16:43.510 --> 16:44.370
Remember this:

16:44.550 --> 16:46.510
the last item on each shelf—

16:46.670 --> 16:49.270
its label
is deliberately placed vertically.

16:49.560 --> 16:50.830
That's a restocking mark.

16:50.830 --> 16:51.790
In the future, if you see

16:51.790 --> 16:53.440
a product with this mark
placed toward the front,

16:53.440 --> 16:54.700
restock it right away.

17:00.360 --> 17:01.320
45.4 yuan.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.450
Just give me 45 yuan.

17:03.440 --> 17:03.910
I've transferred the money.

17:03.910 --> 17:05.369
Okay, thank you. Goodbye.

17:13.310 --> 17:14.069
Zhiyu,

17:14.410 --> 17:15.280
I'm sorry.

17:15.750 --> 17:17.210
It was my fault yesterday.

17:17.790 --> 17:19.069
Are the company matters

17:19.069 --> 17:20.480
very troublesome?

17:25.270 --> 17:26.240
I'm fine, Mom.

17:27.030 --> 17:27.589
Later,

17:28.310 --> 17:29.200
let's talk.

17:36.930 --> 17:37.570
Uncle Xu,

17:37.640 --> 17:38.440
what's wrong?

17:38.790 --> 17:39.480
Zhiyu,

17:39.840 --> 17:42.200
Huang Yide suddenly wants
to leave in a hurry.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.330
I'll be right there.

17:44.270 --> 17:46.480
Huang Yide is still worried
about his wife and child.

17:46.480 --> 17:48.200
As soon as he heard the loan sharks

17:48.200 --> 17:49.070
had found them,

17:49.270 --> 17:50.000
he panicked.

17:50.100 --> 17:51.210
How did he know?

17:51.720 --> 17:54.990
[Uncle Xu]

17:52.020 --> 17:53.950
His wife called this morning,

17:54.070 --> 17:55.360
saying their door was blocked.

17:55.360 --> 17:56.510
They gave an address

17:57.070 --> 17:58.200
and said Huang Yide

17:58.200 --> 17:59.830
must show up today

18:00.280 --> 18:01.540
and pay back the money.

18:02.200 --> 18:02.920
Uncle Xu,

18:04.170 --> 18:05.700
help me calm him down first.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.480
Tell him

18:06.730 --> 18:08.210
I'll handle it for him.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.590
You're going alone?

18:10.590 --> 18:11.640
Is it dangerous?

18:12.270 --> 18:13.030
Don't worry.

18:13.680 --> 18:14.160
Okay.

18:14.480 --> 18:15.610
Be sure to stay safe.

18:15.830 --> 18:16.350
Okay.

18:20.790 --> 18:21.350
Hu Xiu.

18:22.000 --> 18:23.310
Now I need to deal

18:23.310 --> 18:24.490
with Huang Yide's debt matter.

18:24.490 --> 18:25.820
I'll contact you later.

18:44.090 --> 18:46.740
[Sir, he still hasn't come yet.]

18:49.790 --> 18:50.590
Chairman Pei,

18:50.680 --> 18:52.000
Mr. Xiao from D Studio is here.

18:52.000 --> 18:53.070
I told him you're very busy now,

18:53.070 --> 18:53.880
but he...

19:06.080 --> 19:06.920
Stop waiting.

19:07.560 --> 19:08.960
Huang Yide won't show up.

19:13.510 --> 19:15.840
And you don't need to act mysterious here.

19:16.070 --> 19:18.200
I privately paid off some of his debts.

19:19.080 --> 19:21.000
The only person who's still after him

19:21.000 --> 19:21.880
is you.

19:25.350 --> 19:26.070
Zhiyu,

19:27.030 --> 19:28.070
the person you mentioned—

19:28.070 --> 19:29.070
who is he?

19:29.970 --> 19:31.430
I don't quite understand.

19:33.790 --> 19:34.880
Did you come at this moment

19:34.880 --> 19:36.030
to visit me

19:36.050 --> 19:37.910
or to talk about business with me?

19:42.720 --> 19:43.980
Speaking of business,

19:44.680 --> 19:47.070
I did make a pretty good deal recently.

19:47.920 --> 19:49.120
I traded a sum of money

19:49.510 --> 19:51.720
for something very important.

19:55.310 --> 19:56.640
If you really have that thing,

19:56.640 --> 19:58.700
you wouldn't have stepped in for him.

20:08.440 --> 20:09.160
But recently,

20:09.160 --> 20:11.490
I really have been troubled by something.

20:12.680 --> 20:13.790
A supplier

20:14.100 --> 20:15.500
ran into money problems.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.160
I wanted to help him,

20:17.510 --> 20:18.400
but suddenly,

20:18.760 --> 20:20.420
I couldn't reach him anymore.

20:24.450 --> 20:26.490
You must know where he is.

20:33.580 --> 20:35.440
The person you are talking about—

20:35.690 --> 20:37.310
I don't quite understand either.

20:37.310 --> 20:38.830
And I'm not interested in understanding.

20:38.830 --> 20:39.270
Fine.

20:39.480 --> 20:40.480
All right.

20:41.750 --> 20:43.750
Then the whereabouts

20:43.750 --> 20:44.750
of your Ms. Hu—

20:47.520 --> 20:49.050
are you interested in that?

21:20.620 --> 21:21.420
Where is she?

21:25.950 --> 21:26.980
Some time ago,

21:27.000 --> 21:29.260
there was news
about a timber warehouse fire.

21:29.260 --> 21:30.220
Did you see it?

21:32.030 --> 21:33.360
The cause of the fire...

21:34.510 --> 21:35.480
was

21:36.020 --> 21:38.630
a joss stick
that wasn't extinguished in time

21:40.110 --> 21:42.310
ignited the wood dust in the warehouse.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.550
A joss stick

22:01.000 --> 22:03.040
burns for about 20 minutes.

22:04.720 --> 22:05.590
By now,

22:06.270 --> 22:08.000
it should be almost burned out.

22:12.870 --> 22:13.830
Xiao Zhiyu,

22:15.070 --> 22:16.830
your time is running out.

23:37.530 --> 23:38.390
Is anyone here?

23:43.440 --> 23:44.110
Hello?

23:44.110 --> 23:45.110
Fire!

23:48.160 --> 23:49.110
Help!

23:50.030 --> 23:50.920
Help!

23:51.480 --> 23:52.340
Is anyone here?

23:53.590 --> 23:54.480
Help!

23:54.750 --> 23:55.640
Help!

24:15.350 --> 24:16.070
Mr. Pei.

24:16.880 --> 24:17.750
Huang Yide!

24:18.680 --> 24:19.810
You fool.

24:20.780 --> 24:21.350
I...

25:42.760 --> 25:45.360
♪ I wanted you to see the light ♪

25:47.090 --> 25:49.460
♪ But you tried to shut it down ♪

25:49.650 --> 25:52.460
♪ That night ♪

25:51.960 --> 25:52.440
Hu Xiu.

25:52.750 --> 25:53.270
Hu Xiu.

25:53.750 --> 25:56.380
♪ I know I should be dreaming ♪

25:54.440 --> 25:55.000
Hu Xiu.

25:58.090 --> 26:00.370
♪ But I'm still standing here ♪

26:00.690 --> 26:03.130
♪ Trying to take in reality ♪

26:03.630 --> 26:09.690
♪ Just wanna let this storm calm down ♪

26:11.140 --> 26:13.980
♪ But I can not sleep ♪

26:14.490 --> 26:19.220
♪ Because I'm done pretending ♪

26:19.600 --> 26:21.600
♪ And I ♪

26:22.010 --> 26:24.130
♪ I'm ready, I won't hide ♪

26:24.150 --> 26:26.580
♪ Now it's my turn ♪

26:27.760 --> 26:29.840
♪ Even if fate ♪

26:30.410 --> 26:33.080
♪ Cycles on and on ♪

26:34.280 --> 26:38.110
♪ How many tales tomorrow will spawn ♪

26:38.450 --> 26:40.860
♪ I'm free ♪

26:41.060 --> 26:44.060
♪ Winner still unknown ♪

26:44.960 --> 26:48.480
♪ I'll be the one writing my own story ♪

26:49.960 --> 26:50.400
Hu Xiu.

26:50.920 --> 26:51.480
Hu Xiu.

26:51.750 --> 26:52.350
Wake up.

26:52.640 --> 26:53.700
Don't fall asleep.

26:53.960 --> 26:54.880
The ambulance will be here soon.

26:54.880 --> 26:55.750
Hang in there.

26:56.200 --> 26:56.680
Hu Xiu.

26:56.940 --> 26:57.530
Hu Xiu!

27:00.880 --> 27:01.680
It's okay now.

27:04.680 --> 27:06.200
Xiao... Xiao Zhiyu.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.310
I... I'm here.

27:07.550 --> 27:08.160
I'm here.

27:08.720 --> 27:09.030
I'm here.

27:09.030 --> 27:10.070
I'm fine. I...

27:10.200 --> 27:10.960
I'm okay.

27:15.440 --> 27:16.200
I'm alright.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.240
It's fine now.

27:18.880 --> 27:19.510
I'm okay.

27:24.550 --> 27:25.480
Don't you think

27:26.510 --> 27:28.790
we're just like in a murder mystery game?

27:29.920 --> 27:30.580
You know...

27:30.830 --> 27:32.430
like that haunted house one.

27:34.310 --> 27:35.200
At a time like this,

27:35.200 --> 27:36.530
you're still laughing?

27:40.440 --> 27:41.000
So,

27:42.190 --> 27:44.540
did you get the mayor's command token?

27:46.080 --> 27:47.160
Qin Xiaoyi.

27:55.350 --> 27:57.070
The last item on each shelf—

27:57.070 --> 27:59.240
its label
is deliberately placed vertically.

27:59.240 --> 28:00.700
That's a restocking mark.

28:02.390 --> 28:04.320
I suddenly remembered something.

28:20.640 --> 28:23.310
In the room where Mr. Huang
stores the concrete test blocks,

28:23.310 --> 28:25.710
one test block
has a very special marking code.

28:25.710 --> 28:27.550
The others all have professional QR codes,

28:27.550 --> 28:29.410
but only that one is handwritten.

28:36.480 --> 28:37.110
Uncle Xu,

28:37.790 --> 28:39.450
go to Huang Yide's factory now

28:39.510 --> 28:41.440
and look for a concrete test block.

29:52.730 --> 29:53.860
Get more people

29:54.110 --> 29:55.310
to keep pushing the story about Xiao Zhiyu

29:55.310 --> 29:56.640
leaking trade secrets.

29:57.600 --> 29:58.400
Also,

29:59.200 --> 30:00.400
bring up the construction accident

30:00.400 --> 30:02.090
related to his father from back then

30:02.090 --> 30:03.050
as well.

30:04.000 --> 30:04.550
Okay.

30:05.770 --> 30:07.730
As for Forma's suppliers,

30:08.590 --> 30:09.960
let them continue

30:10.110 --> 30:12.350
to fully safeguard their own rights.

30:12.550 --> 30:13.590
Understand?

30:14.750 --> 30:15.510
Yes, Mr. Pei.

30:16.350 --> 30:17.160
You're faltering.

30:17.160 --> 30:18.620
Is there something wrong?

30:19.310 --> 30:19.880
Mr. Pei,

30:20.240 --> 30:21.370
there is something.

30:21.590 --> 30:22.240
Go ahead.

30:23.070 --> 30:24.200
It's about Ms. Hu.

30:24.510 --> 30:25.110
I think...

30:25.330 --> 30:26.570
I should tell you.

30:28.750 --> 30:29.720
What about her?

30:30.510 --> 30:32.200
I think today, Chairman Pei sent people

30:32.200 --> 30:33.240
to take Ms. Hu

30:33.440 --> 30:34.920
to a warehouse.

30:50.550 --> 30:51.440
I heard...

30:51.470 --> 30:53.390
a fire broke out in that warehouse later.

30:53.390 --> 30:54.350
But don't worry.

30:54.370 --> 30:55.480
She's fine now.

30:57.350 --> 30:58.750
Chairman Pei doing that—

30:58.860 --> 31:00.970
could it be targeting... Xiao Zhiyu?

31:03.790 --> 31:04.960
The weather is dry.

31:05.550 --> 31:07.160
A small fire is normal.

31:07.360 --> 31:09.750
Remember to handle
the surveillance footage.

31:09.750 --> 31:10.610
What matters is

31:10.630 --> 31:11.700
the thing I want!

31:12.010 --> 31:12.870
Did you find it?

31:14.450 --> 31:16.400
The concrete test block
where Huang Yide hid it

31:16.400 --> 31:17.530
seems to be missing.

31:18.280 --> 31:19.680
Then force him to find it!

31:27.880 --> 31:29.680
What are you standing there for?

31:35.500 --> 31:37.100
Do you have something to say?

31:38.590 --> 31:39.200
Dad.

31:41.830 --> 31:42.880
Why did you...

31:47.100 --> 31:48.830
You could have come at me alone.

31:49.200 --> 31:50.960
Causing her father's car accident,

31:50.960 --> 31:51.920
getting her suspected
of leaking information—

31:51.920 --> 31:53.450
is that how you protect her?

31:55.270 --> 31:57.130
How could I have forgotten before

31:57.200 --> 31:59.200
that the blood flowing in your veins

31:59.550 --> 32:01.240
is the same as his?

32:05.870 --> 32:07.600
What exactly do you want to ask?

32:15.430 --> 32:16.230
Nothing.

33:17.550 --> 33:20.060
Once I'm done
with Forma's business in a few days,

33:20.060 --> 33:22.190
you're coming back to the U.S. with me.

33:24.330 --> 33:25.760
I won't go back with you.

33:29.310 --> 33:30.310
I'll get the door.

33:57.210 --> 33:58.140
Why are you here?

33:59.750 --> 34:01.680
I'm here to talk about the accident

34:01.920 --> 34:03.990
at the Xincheng Stadium 20 years ago.

34:14.230 --> 34:15.630
20 years ago.

34:17.860 --> 34:19.570
That's all bygones.

34:20.880 --> 34:22.230
Bygones?

34:24.000 --> 34:25.590
But for my father,

34:26.360 --> 34:28.889
it's an injustice
he's suffered for 20 years.

34:36.010 --> 34:38.070
Do you need me to refresh your memory?

34:39.840 --> 34:41.840
On January 8, 2004,

34:42.070 --> 34:44.280
the Xincheng Stadium's roof collapsed,

34:44.280 --> 34:46.080
causing 3 deaths and 6 injuries.

34:47.150 --> 34:48.320
That accident

34:48.320 --> 34:50.400
was concluded long ago
by the expert panel.

34:50.400 --> 34:52.320
It was your father's decision error

34:52.320 --> 34:53.030
coupled with sudden strong winds.

34:53.030 --> 34:54.400
Decision error?

34:59.630 --> 35:01.440
My dad used Q345B steel—

35:01.440 --> 35:03.410
the design strength of the steel
fully met the standards.

35:03.410 --> 35:06.110
The problem was
someone used inferior materials.

35:06.110 --> 35:06.710
Pei Zhen,

35:07.000 --> 35:08.000
you work in engineering.

35:08.000 --> 35:08.760
You should know

35:08.760 --> 35:09.710
the difference

35:09.710 --> 35:11.510
between Q235B and Q345B, right?

35:16.590 --> 35:18.720
The strength differs by a whole grade,

35:19.230 --> 35:21.030
but they look almost identical.

35:21.720 --> 35:22.400
Exactly.

35:23.210 --> 35:24.940
During procurement back then,

35:25.230 --> 35:27.030
your father used 30% Q235B steel

35:27.280 --> 35:28.880
to pass it off as Q345B steel,

35:29.210 --> 35:30.940
and pocketed 2 million yuan in kickbacks.

35:30.940 --> 35:31.800
That's absurd.

35:32.800 --> 35:35.280
Based on just a few photos
of unclear origin—

35:35.280 --> 35:36.280
is that credible?

35:36.800 --> 35:38.460
You want the memory card, huh?

35:42.060 --> 35:42.660
By the way,

35:42.960 --> 35:44.800
your people aren't still with Huang Yide

35:44.800 --> 35:47.460
looking for that concrete test block,
are they?

35:50.690 --> 35:52.480
It was such a big project.

35:52.960 --> 35:54.960
Only that tiny bit of cheap steel
was used.

35:54.960 --> 35:55.880
What's the big deal?

35:55.880 --> 35:56.840
In this line of work,

35:56.840 --> 35:57.360
who doesn't...

35:57.360 --> 35:59.220
Who doesn't take a little? Right?

36:10.800 --> 36:11.920
But only you

36:13.280 --> 36:15.340
forged a document after the incident

36:16.280 --> 36:18.340
and shifted all the blame onto my dad.

36:25.440 --> 36:26.370
Look carefully.

36:26.710 --> 36:27.880
It's in black and white.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.610
Your father signed it himself.

36:30.270 --> 36:31.730
Why did you say I forged it?

36:32.400 --> 36:34.400
Do you want a handwriting appraisal?

36:34.400 --> 36:36.260
Or I can call Huang Yide right now.

36:36.510 --> 36:37.880
Let's see if he'll testify against you

36:37.880 --> 36:39.480
in order to protect himself.

36:40.720 --> 36:42.780
Even if he didn't sign this document,

36:42.880 --> 36:45.140
could he really escape responsibility?

36:46.190 --> 36:48.790
Otherwise, why would he choose
to end his life?

36:51.840 --> 36:52.970
Is it really true...

36:54.020 --> 36:55.820
that my father took his own life?

37:01.550 --> 37:03.840
He jumped from the building himself!

37:04.560 --> 37:05.900
Everyone knew that back then!

37:05.900 --> 37:07.160
Then where were you at the time?

37:07.160 --> 37:08.360
I already explained.

37:08.550 --> 37:10.350
I wasn't at the stadium that day.

37:20.340 --> 37:21.570
That night,

37:21.630 --> 37:23.370
as soon as the accident occurred,

37:23.370 --> 37:26.000
I rushed to the scene with Mr. Chen.

37:26.710 --> 37:28.640
On the way, we picked up one person—

37:29.340 --> 37:30.900
Pei Kanghua.

37:39.510 --> 37:40.440
Then what about

37:40.570 --> 37:41.970
the last text message

37:42.000 --> 37:43.080
Yuze sent?

37:47.710 --> 37:49.400
That text message said...

37:53.510 --> 37:54.360
"I'm sorry.

37:56.590 --> 37:58.280
It's all my fault.

38:00.630 --> 38:02.030
Take good care of Xiaoyi

38:04.000 --> 38:05.730
and make sure he grows up well."

38:13.150 --> 38:13.840
Yes.

38:15.090 --> 38:16.700
Xiaoyi is indeed my name.

38:18.070 --> 38:19.670
But what you might not know is

38:21.200 --> 38:24.150
my dad only called me by my pet name, Yi.

38:50.000 --> 38:51.530
With such a major accident,

38:52.190 --> 38:54.360
his whole life would surely be ruined!

38:55.280 --> 38:56.540
If he had listened to me

38:56.670 --> 38:58.590
and taken the blame
for everything back then,

38:58.590 --> 38:59.110
then...

38:59.670 --> 39:01.840
sooner or later
I would have helped him make a comeback.

39:01.840 --> 39:03.590
But he insisted on exposing me.

39:09.400 --> 39:10.800
I didn't mean to harm him.

39:11.230 --> 39:12.630
God helped me,

39:13.170 --> 39:15.170
letting me achieve fame and success

39:15.480 --> 39:18.000
and earn money
to support you and your mother!

39:18.000 --> 39:18.920
Without me,

39:19.190 --> 39:20.430
just those debts alone

39:20.430 --> 39:22.030
would have crushed you both!

39:22.670 --> 39:24.110
You should be grateful.

39:24.690 --> 39:25.690
In this world,

39:25.760 --> 39:27.590
who doesn't look out for themselves
in crisis?

39:27.590 --> 39:29.480
Only you killed so many people!

39:29.680 --> 39:32.480
You made my father
bear the blame for so many years!

39:49.030 --> 39:49.920
But now...

39:53.400 --> 39:54.470
it's your turn.
